[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0712","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0712.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0912","title":"FreeBSD vfs_cache 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 操作系统的 VFS 文件系统缓存（vfs_cache）机制存在资源耗尽缺陷。具有本地账户权限的攻击者可以通过在系统中打开大量文件描述符来消耗内核文件缓存资源和文件表项，导致系统缓存溢出或文件表耗尽，从而使合法用户无法正常创建或访问文件，造成服务拒绝。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 2.x 及 3.x 早期版本，攻击条件为攻击者已拥有本地 shell 访问权限且系统未施加文件描述符数量限制。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0912"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1999-09-22T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:18Z","remediation":"将受影响的 FreeBSD 系统升级到 3.3-RELEASE 或更高版本，该版本已修复 vfs_cache 文件描述符资源耗尽缺陷。如暂无法升级，可通过 login.conf 中配置 openfiles 参数限制普通用户可同时打开的文件描述符数量，并收紧本地账户权限，减少非授权用户获取 shell 的机会，以此作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1079","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/653","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0912"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0712.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0712.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0712.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0297","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0297.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0708","title":"cfingerd GECOS 字段缓冲区溢出提权漏洞","description":"cfingerd 是一款可配置的 finger 服务守护程序，在解析用户 GECOS 字段时未正确限制输入长度，导致存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可设置超长 GECOS 字段触发溢出，覆盖返回地址执行任意代码，从而获取 root 权限并完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0708"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-09-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-09-21T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 cfingerd 至 1.4.3 或更高版本以修复缓冲区溢出问题；如非必要，建议直接禁用 cfingerd 服务或替换为更安全的 finger 守护程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/651","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0708","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19504"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19504"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0297.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1208","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0909","title":"Microsoft Windows 多宿主系统 IP 源路由绕过漏洞","description":"Windows 95/98/NT 的多宿主系统在处理带有特定 IP 选项的畸形数据包时存在安全漏洞。远程攻击者可利用特制数据包绕过 IP 源路由限制，实施 IP 地址欺骗攻击，获取对受影响系统的未授权访问权限，导致信息泄露或权限提升。该漏洞又名 Spoofed Route Pointer。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0909"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-09-20T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"微软已发布安全公告 MS99-038 修复此漏洞，建议受影响用户安装对应的安全更新补丁 KB238453，或升级到已修复的操作系统版本。在多宿主系统上禁用 IP 源路由功能也可作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T23:56:41Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ238453","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/646","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-038"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0521","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0521.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0787","title":"SSH Communications Security SSH 1.2.27 认证代理符号链接漏洞","description":"SSH Communications Security 公司出品的 SSH 1.2.27 版本中，ssh-agent 认证代理在创建用于身份认证的 UNIX 域套接字文件时，未对路径进行符号链接检查。本地攻击者可在 agent 预期创建 socket 的目录下预先放置一个指向任意目标文件（如 ~/.rhosts 或系统关键配置文件）的符号链接。当 agent 启动并跟随该符号链接创建套接字文件时，会以当前用户权限在符号链接指向的位置创建或覆盖文件，从而篡改受保护文件内容，可能造成权限提升或账户被非法信任。该漏洞为本地利用型，攻击条件要求攻击者在目标主机上拥有普通用户账户并能控制文件系统布局，影响范围仅限于 SSH 1.2.27 版本，CVSS 基础评分为 2.1，危害程度较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0787"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:03Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 SSH Communications Security SSH 至 1.2.28 或更高版本（该版本已修复认证代理跟随符号链接的问题）。如暂无法升级，可手动设置 SSH_AUTH_SOCK 指向仅当前用户可写的专用目录（如 ~/.ssh-agent），并以 chmod 700 限制该目录权限，禁止其他用户创建符号链接；同时避免在共享或不可信目录中运行 ssh-agent 以作临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93760201002154&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93832856804415&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/660","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19510","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/19dfa989c2a07b8fd71870a139a7d171f621ff41/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0787.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0787","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0787.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9ef5a1e2753195eb4be450895da310f7a8a6524e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0787.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-93v8-gx5g-v586/GHSA-93v8-gx5g-v586.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0787.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--76e0f930-9120-4d0c-b52e-6cf26ac3a600.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/95667eace3f4d053cefbe6b54fe10b3647ab0f79/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0521.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0521.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0521.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1168","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0886","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 RASMAN 权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 的远程访问服务管理器（RASMAN）安全描述符配置不当，允许用户通过 Windows NT 服务控制管理器将 RASMAN 指向替代位置加载恶意 DLL，导致本地攻击者以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码。攻击者需拥有本地登录权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0886"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"1999-09-17T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 Windows 2000 或更高版本系统，Windows NT 4.0 已于 2004 年停止支持，不再提供安全更新。如无法升级，在注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\RasMan 中限制仅 SYSTEM 账户拥有写入权限，并禁用 Remote Access Service 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ242294","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/645","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-041"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1500","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1500.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0953","title":"WWWBoard 2.0 远程密码泄露漏洞","description":"WWWBoard 2.0 存在敏感信息泄露漏洞，其将加密后的用户密码存储在 `passwd.txt` 文件中，且该文件位于 Web 根目录下。远程攻击者无需身份认证，直接通过浏览器访问该文件路径即可获取所有用户的加密密码，进而可尝试离线破解获取明文密码，严重威胁系统安全。该漏洞影响 WWWBoard 2.0 版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0953"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:23Z","remediation":"将 passwd.txt 移至 Web 根目录之外（如 /etc/wwboard/），或通过 .htaccess 添加 `<Files passwd.txt> Deny from all</Files>` 限制访问。由于 WWWBoard 已停止维护，建议迁移至现代论坛系统（如 phpBB 或 Discourse）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0953","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/3065","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58316128f65d22a226717ff1f92ebf2058e46bc6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0953.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0953","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/8854c056beab250ba690e2bcc8887feb4c1f8139/1999/CVE-1999-0953/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-0953.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4d2ed764072119c12b6f84e6ee4e0df62586a8c4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0953.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/807.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/95e6ff620d5494b93ba2234edfcf6a45187dc0a8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7x89-22x4-gr9x/GHSA-7x89-22x4-gr9x.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/554ca72965233bd9402be197b5470aad836fe056/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-09xx/CVE-1999-0953.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/wwwboardpwd.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1500.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1500.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1500.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0707","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0707.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0907","title":"soundcard_cw 本地任意文件读取漏洞","description":"sccw（soundcard_cw）工具存在任意文件读取漏洞，本地攻击者可利用该工具读取系统上任意文件内容，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞源于 sccw 在文件读取操作中未对文件路径进行充分的权限校验，攻击者只需拥有本地系统访问权限即可利用，无需额外认证。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，仅影响机密性，不影响完整性和可用性。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0907"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-09-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:18Z","remediation":"移除 sccw 程序的 setuid 权限位：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/sccw`。如无需使用声卡控制功能，建议直接卸载相关软件包：`apt-get remove sccw` 或 `yum remove sccw`。作为临时缓解措施，可通过 `chmod 000 /usr/bin/sccw` 禁止所有用户执行该程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0907","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b620a68f213580a6ffea66162a8ff5e007fc8af7/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0907.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0907","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0907.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cc69bd737a75cf8d608267baabc212a8abe28cf/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0907.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ebc4e3f46b7b9c5edb49036dec833178204180ea/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-79vr-x4wq-mxhp/GHSA-79vr-x4wq-mxhp.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0907.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88369/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e31a1d9e-5ea8-4b69-982d-6458fdafd6dc.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/178b809924783e13787d17bb1b1fd55ad3b8639b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0907.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0707.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0707.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0682","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0682.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0890","title":"iHTML Merchant 代码执行信息泄露漏洞","description":"iHTML Merchant 电子商务购物车软件存在代码解析错误漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送特制请求，利用该解析缺陷获取服务器敏感信息或执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 iHTML Merchant 全版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已发布安全补丁，建议用户及时更新至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0890"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:16Z","remediation":"iHTML Merchant 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议立即迁移至其他受支持的电子商务平台。如无法立即迁移，应在防火墙层面限制仅允许可信 IP 访问该服务，并移除服务器上不必要的文件权限，同时部署 WAF 规则拦截异常代码执行请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ihtmlmerchant.com/support_patches_feedback.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/694","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e17eb087fb437c23db93be0dd8d10804be51087/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0890.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0890","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0890.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1eab609178bfac1fdc1fdc37b8b4d17d9ecf98b7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0890.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/799c403529fad0f67d5473eea397e9968232a5ec/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-68rf-prjw-8c5h/GHSA-68rf-prjw-8c5h.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0890.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000779.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_infor.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0682.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0333","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0704","title":"Linux/BSD am-utils amd 守护进程日志记录缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Berkeley automounter daemon（amd）的日志记录功能存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统发送特制的请求触发该漏洞，导致拒绝服务或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 BSD/OS 3.1/4.0.1、FreeBSD 3.0/3.1/3.2 及 RedHat Linux 6.0 等使用 am-utils 软件包的系统，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0704"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:53Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 am-utils 至 6.0.1 或更高版本（该版本修复了 amd 日志记录功能的缓冲区溢出漏洞）。对于 RedHat Linux 6.0，可安装官方提供的 am-utils 安全更新包。如无法升级，可在 inetd 配置中禁用 amd 服务，或通过防火墙限制 amd 端口（默认 672/udp）的访问来源。对于 FreeBSD/BSD/OS 系统，建议升级至已修复该漏洞的后续版本或迁移至现代受支持的操作系统版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/614","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19479","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/32372dcb4b973a68d35643516e5e8206f397c85b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0704.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0704","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0704.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/30f77465b94d71209b45a239e791a1fe062c9e8b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0704.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1906.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/rpc.rules","https://github.com/bailehang/snort_2.2.0/blob/34f8a3a85f15645aea53d6e0d46863c7c57e43ef/doc/signatures/1905.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/rpc_amd.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a1a39f51-3877-479a-ad5b-fc201e242044.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0744","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0744.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0954","title":"WWWBoard 默认用户名和密码漏洞","description":"WWWBoard 是一款基于 Perl 的 Web 留言板系统，其默认安装包含预设的管理员用户名和密码（通常为 admin/admin）。远程攻击者无需身份验证即可利用默认凭据登录管理后台，从而完全控制留言板系统，包括删除/修改帖子、管理用户等操作。攻击条件简单，仅需网络可达即可。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0954"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-09-16T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-11-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装后立即修改默认管理员用户名和密码，删除或禁用默认账户，并限制管理后台的访问 IP 范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T04:21:47Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/649","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0954"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0744.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0744.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0744.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0888","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0888.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0817","title":"Lynx WWW 客户端 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Lynx 文本模式网页浏览器在调用外部程序处理特定协议（如 telnet）时，未对用户可控的命令行参数进行有效过滤，导致远程攻击者可构造包含恶意命令行参数的特制 URL（如 telnet:// 协议链接），诱导受害者在 Lynx 中打开，从而在受害者系统上以当前用户权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Lynx 多个版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，属严重级别远程命令执行漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，仅需诱导用户点击恶意链接即可触发命令注入，导致任意代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0817"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:07Z","remediation":"升级 Lynx 至 2.8.1rel.2 或 2.8.2 及以上修复版本（如从源码编译请打上官方安全补丁）。临时缓解措施：在 lynx.cfg 中注释或移除 TELNET、TN3270 等外部程序调用配置（如 `TELNET_PROGRAM`），并禁止 Lynx 通过 telnet:// 等协议拉起外部程序；同时以低权限用户运行 Lynx，限制其对系统命令的调用能力。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0817","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/df06113bb625f86b49f1950d55874a29f8e76a55/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0817.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0817","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/8854c056beab250ba690e2bcc8887feb4c1f8139/1999/CVE-1999-0817/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0817.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5297adfba5e91ee22e711c26c523b292d427c0d0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0817.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/90b464bbc2d1b64270a5771429f96b67fbe9e79b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-354v-9299-wg75/GHSA-354v-9299-wg75.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0817.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88360/info.html","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0888.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1686","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1053","title":"Matt Wright Guestbook.pl 服务端包含（SSI）远程命令执行漏洞","description":"guestbook.pl 是 Matt Wright 开发的 Perl CGI 留言板程序。该程序在过滤用户提交的服务器端包含（SSI）指令时，仅通过移除 \"<!--\" 与 \"-->\" 分隔符之间的内容来净化输入，过滤逻辑存在缺陷。当 guestbook.pl 运行于 Apache 1.3.9 及可能其他版本时，由于 Apache 允许使用除 \"-->\" 之外的其他闭合序列，远程攻击者可在留言中插入特制的 SSI 指令绕过过滤，从而在目标服务器上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响使用受影响版本 guestbook.pl 并部署于存在缺陷 Apache 版本的 Web 站点，攻击条件为攻击者无需认证即可向留言板提交内容，利用方式是通过构造绕过注释闭合规则的恶意 SSI 语句实现服务端命令执行。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1053"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:36Z","remediation":"立即将 guestbook.pl 升级至 Matt Wright 官方发布的修复版本（建议 2.3.2 或更高版本），该版本已修复 SSI 过滤逻辑，可正确识别并移除所有 SSI 命令（包括非标准闭合序列）。如无法立即升级，应在 Apache 配置中对 guestbook.pl 所在目录禁用服务器端包含功能，添加 `Options -Includes` 指令阻止 SSI 解析。作为临时缓解措施，可在 guestbook.pl 脚本入口处增加输入过滤，正则匹配并删除所有包含 `#exec`、`#include`、`#config` 等 SSI 指令的内容，防止用户输入被注入执行。长期建议替换为其他维护状态活跃的留言板程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/33674","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/82/27296","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/82/27560","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/776","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/9907","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1053.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2672e36893bd220d6f65c955e260796d11ed64b/1999/CVE-1999-1053.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/ebd0bd601a59b74d0f92e5baa446be886d6ae85a/1999/CVE-1999-1053/CVE-1999-1053-PoC.py","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1053","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/5afdd8595bdd7f42c7b239ab44a422e2dd6b9f2e/1999/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/1999/CVE-1999-1053.rules","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dde4d96d7c1eff197b9a15817af615500736afa7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1053.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/ffab8835dab57629dd708bbd389c0fd0b4f23ace/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/1999/database/CVE-1999-1053/CVE-1999-1053-PoC-siunam321.md","https://github.com/gottburgm/Exploits/blob/fd340a05cbec416e89bfae898e27bf5fcb429101/MSFExploits/GUESTBOOK/MSF/SsiExec_infos.txt","https://github.com/siunam321/CVE-1999-1053-PoC"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1686.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1686.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0609","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0759","title":"FuseWare FuseMail 2.7 POP 邮件服务缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"此漏洞影响FuseMail 2.7版本，存在POP服务处理机制缺陷，当攻击者向目标系统发送超长USER或PASS命令时，服务器端的缓冲区缓冲区溢出，导致远程代码执行。根据CVSS评分10.0，该漏洞危害等级极高，影响范围广泛。攻击者无需任何身份验证即可远程触发此漏洞，对系统安全造成严重威胁。该漏洞由攻击者构造恶意网络请求实现，其影响可能导致完全控制目标主机。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0759"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-09-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:59Z","remediation":"立即升级到 FuseMail 2.7.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 POP 服务中 USER/PASS 命令长度验证漏洞；并在 /etc/fusemail/fusemail.conf 中添加 \"pop_max_line_length=1024\" 配置以限制命令长度输入；如无法立即升级，可通过防火墙禁用默认 POP 端口110/995，避免外部网络访问，以及限制源IP地址范围至内部网络。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.crosswinds.net/~fuseware/faq.html#8","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/634","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19496","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e268305fd8644994d337819e469d1f89bafde833/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0759.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0759","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/8854c056beab250ba690e2bcc8887feb4c1f8139/1999/CVE-1999-0759/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca